(II)--Agni with मारुत (wind) ordered by Indra to destroy the Asuras; when some of them escaped to the ocean and हुताशन and मारुत refused to dry up the oceans as per his orders Indra caused them to be born on the earth with one body;
1: M. ६१. 3-१६; Br. II. ११. १००, ११२.
riding animal of, sheep; his arm was शक्ति; appointed a commander of Indra's host to attack तारक;
2: M. १४८. ८३; २८९. 6.
father of all the Apsarasa ladies;
3: Ib. ७०. २१.
entered the harem of शिव and उमा in the form of a parrot and drank of His वीर्य;
4: Ib. १५८. ३२.
burnt with काम and reattained godhood.
5: Ib. १९१. ११२.
